                <p className="text-white font-medium">Data for decentralized finance.</p>
                <p className="text-slate-400">MONETA Oracle is designed to support applications that depend on accurate and timely financial information.</p>
                <p className="text-slate-400">Potential use cases include lending, collateralization, derivatives, stablecoins, and asset management.</p>
                <p className="text-slate-400 border-l-2 border-slate-700 pl-4 py-1 italic">The oracle becomes a critical data layer between external markets and on-chain financial logic.</p>
              </section>

              {/* 11 */}
              <section className="space-y-6">
                <div className="flex items-center gap-4">
                  <span className="text-cyan-500 font-mono font-bold text-xl">11</span>
                  <h3 className="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-widest uppercase">— RWA DATA INFRASTRUCTURE</h3>
