                <p className="text-slate-400">Real-world assets require information that does not naturally originate on a blockchain.</p>
                <p className="text-slate-400">MONETA Oracle can provide infrastructure for approved data relating to asset valuations, market conditions, external events, and ownership information.</p>
              </section>
