                <p className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">That means pursuing:</p>
                <div className="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-sm text-cyan-400 font-mono">
                  <div>Transparent architecture</div>
