            <div className="space-y-2 text-slate-400 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
              <p>You should not have to choose between:</p>
              <div className="text-white font-medium py-4 space-y-2">
                <p>Speed and verification.</p>
                <p>Coverage and security.</p>
                <p>Flexibility and reliability.</p>
                <p>Cross-chain access and strong verification.</p>
              </div>
              <p>MONETA Oracle is building toward a different model.</p>
            </div>

            <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-cyan-400 mb-16">
