              <div className="bg-[#0a0b14] border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded">A verification-first architecture.</div>
              <div className="bg-[#0a0b14] border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded">A multi-chain future.</div>
              <div className="bg-[#0a0b14] border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded">A developer-focused infrastructure.</div>
              <div className="bg-[#0a0b14] border border-slate-800 p-4 rounded">A data network designed for the next generation of decentralized applications.</div>
            </div>

            <div className="space-y-6 mb-12">
              <div className="text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tighter">
                ONE FEED. EVERY CHAIN. ABSOLUTE TRUTH.
